# Build output
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Never commit data, environments or toolchains to this repository. Every rule is anchored to the
# repository root with a leading slash: an unanchored `data/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth, which silently excluded the per-figure source data in figures/data/ that the paper
# cites. The nine derived artefacts the paper cites are tracked deliberately, under evidence/, and
# are listed in EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.csv.
/data/
/.venv/
/.tools/
/.env
